{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/0/content","kr_sha":"ba7e65a7a5e5f99418acf5ecff11717a9105edb77fce2bef5b8fd3b192574b62","zh":"那是硝煙瀰漫的空間。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/1/content","kr_sha":"9643c1cd9dfc24c0cd84bb2e76451fdfedcc3a38683ee7e3b64e8b688ea2d596","zh":"雖然空間寬廣，天空也足夠開闊。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/2/content","kr_sha":"291d908bbfc83ef58fcc373a13e602d3d58ca978d515cf81431ddaa7c685aa06","zh":"但血與土的氣味充斥著雙肺，令我感到痛苦，粗重而短促的呼吸反覆模糊我的視野。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/3/content","kr_sha":"e1194837ab1d2a021cf6ba3803481b5232ff083c37316203d21a4f455eb3cb99","zh":"那裡充斥著鞋子踩踏在地板上的聲音，拳頭毆打著腹部、肋骨、面部、胸腔。那是不論何處都能穿來被刺入的聲響的地獄。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/4/content","kr_sha":"9a85ce0c26d9bb5d2ddc87fba740bd484750aa16eadb90b5af4703395cdd7bc2","zh":"以及難以計數的我，我，與我。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/5/content","kr_sha":"d40f7976bdcc5ab6c3871e0429fbe1ade43b2d4b634becef30a81079e4b50a02","zh":"那裡被稱為孵化室。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/6/content","kr_sha":"66eddf84e92a9fd56830000490d484c6455114de241d4e59b432b5fcd16bee20","zh":"任何人都必須經歷孵化室，才能成為R公司的戰鬥員。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/7/content","kr_sha":"b3a79f3270b851aef9f1a8a9777e8c08ed6927b9c6ebdc9a87b246ddba3a5abf","zh":"在那之中是克隆出的無數的自己。如同被關入昏暗壺中的毒蟲一般，和無數的自己戰鬥，只為了在其中活下來。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/8/content","kr_sha":"1e1c1a57d1109038699c040a7080b051db2128b448ce6140784cd0dad7daca04","zh":"如此便能夠在短時間內獲得戰鬥經驗，並且篩選出最優秀的一個。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/9/content","kr_sha":"3f6cba358aba6c7595976db49f50d62ef8b49dda25183c2fd2a94e4f63b62bf5","zh":"因此，活下來的究竟是不是原型並不重要。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/10/content","kr_sha":"effc9e5e8a5d7b244ca32efac2b5be014db2529fc4c1cd58ee1e19bf85729840","zh":"因為最終，複製體中最為優秀的那人將會成為「我」。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/11/content","kr_sha":"9aee8cdb602cfcdb2e3df38c1ab2a707125d8a397d6857567681bf3e62506d87","zh":"於是花費時間選拔出的我，經由他們得以孵化。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/12/content","kr_sha":"c440435f369a8a3b40fe2a924597011abdb4a1d93907b8e7196aabb9b4c88152","zh":"為了驅動龐大的外骨骼裝甲，我接受了適應手術，隨後得到和自己相配的裝甲。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/13/content","kr_sha":"a44798282803d3a9d6c742b7027ba1b6aa8f719f482ef37563ecbd07c12057c2","zh":"即使離開了孵化室，也不代表一切已經結束。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/14/content","kr_sha":"4b13e140533ec87a0af28860ab9238781ee414cc1bf79c6f7ee3dae06301c9ff","zh":"那龐大的裝甲在不斷吸收著生物能。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/15/content","kr_sha":"0fbf6d042b398422b9e761e76f3439848bad2a860bf51de404272359cf204b2f","zh":"所謂的適應手術，是將我的能量轉換成裝甲的能量。我被分配到的隊伍認為這是理所當然的。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/16/content","kr_sha":"f7866712ce2341eb7b5ca4bd769a6c7135e351f96379f22923eb117c5d556d28","zh":"這工作並不輕鬆。裝甲中的同事與我都不斷地抱怨這種裝甲造成的疲勞。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/17/content","kr_sha":"266e8feb60fa45d9e64c5e6cfdb35a5693db07d91448ecc745679b2987b75738","zh":"但我們自掏腰包補充咖啡因和糖分，或許是寧願將這裝甲當做小事，也想避免回到那個可怖的孵化室。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/18/content","kr_sha":"4e3a5aaa3e2f2ba9f6cb04c8a5a20a31b4bf065e8dedd48a0f19cacccf047680","zh":"如果不能在戰鬥中達到預期的結果，就會被拖回孵化室……","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/19/content","kr_sha":"03d0b4975f69f0025ac3735ff5ef217239607a23b3ca3ad7e7154faa0ebd5a48","zh":"回到與我、我和我互為敵人的，漫無止境的戰鬥。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/20/content","kr_sha":"6ab8f41572e00a07e1bfc970c344d9385a396bebfd443192f0a28b47d6dc804d","zh":"與拿著厚重武器的其他同事不同，我一直使用著硬化腕刀；這麼做的理由也一樣。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10506.json|/dataList/21/content","kr_sha":"894698e293a751f29084fae4bc9fd95a1c1d8303d41d5a717261940dfd168a50","zh":"因為我……正是憑此存活下來的。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
